---
import { DOCS } from '../../site';
import CliReadout from './CliReadout.astro';
---
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="cmds-title" style="padding-top:60px">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="intro reveal">
      <div class="kicker">The CLI</div>
      <h2 class="h2" id="cmds-title" data-words>One CLI for you and your agents.</h2>
      <p>Your agents run the same commands through the bundled <code>devtwin-*</code> skills. Anything that leaves your machine waits for you.</p>
    </div>
    <CliReadout />
    <div class="cmds reveal">
      <div class="cmdc"><code><span>›</span> project onboard</code><p>Scan a repo into proposed context.</p></div>
      <div class="cmdc"><code><span>›</span> context brief</code><p>The bounded brief for this project.</p></div>
      <div class="cmdc"><code><span>›</span> context resolve</code><p>Which scope, project and identity apply here.</p></div>
      <div class="cmdc"><code><span>›</span> record add</code><p>Capture a decision, fact or constraint.</p></div>
      <div class="cmdc"><code><span>›</span> activity</code><p>What devtwin learned this week, and what waits for you.</p></div>
      <div class="cmdc"><code><span>›</span> record supersede</code><p>Replace a record, keep the history.</p></div>
      <div class="cmdc"><code><span>›</span> lesson match</code><p>Lessons for the files in hand.</p></div>
      <div class="cmdc"><code><span>›</span> undo</code><p>Reverse an automatic write.</p></div>
      <div class="cmdc"><code><span>›</span> lesson accept</code><p>Save a lesson for this project, every project or your team.</p></div>
      <div class="cmdc"><code><span>›</span> hub sync</code><p>Trade lessons and notes with your org's hub.</p></div>
      <div class="cmdc"><code><span>›</span> handoff write</code><p>Leave the next step for the next session.</p></div>
      <div class="cmdc"><code><span>›</span> handoff export</code><p>Selected records as a Markdown packet.</p></div>
      <div class="cmdc"><code><span>›</span> import run</code><p>Promote Claude memory and docs/solutions into records.</p></div>
      <div class="cmdc"><code><span>›</span> agents install</code><p>Put the skills and hooks into Claude Code, Codex and Gemini CLI.</p></div>
      <div class="cmdc"><code><span>›</span> setup</code><p>A guided setup, one step at a time.</p></div>
      <div class="cmdc"><code><span>›</span> profile apply</code><p>Set up your private personal profile.</p></div>
      <div class="cmdc"><code><span>›</span> skill template-seed</code><p>Turn a template into your own skill.</p></div>
      <div class="cmdc"><code><span>›</span> stack digest</code><p>Your weekly radar: vendor news and new tools for your stack.</p></div>
      <div class="cmdc"><code><span>›</span> backup create</code><p>An encrypted backup of your store.</p></div>
      <div class="cmdc"><code><span>›</span> doctor</code><p>Check setup, boundaries and permissions.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="section-more reveal"><a class="p-more" href={DOCS.cli}>Full CLI reference <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
  </div>
</section>
